[2026-09-22 20:41:53] REQ 260922203052-97 RESPONSE http=200 body_tail={"model":"glm-5.3-flash","created_at":"2026-09-22T20:41:53.353671Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_1d9gfaix","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/.emacs.d/gptel-fork\ngit add gptel.el gptel-request.el\ngit commit -m \"per-turn post-response regions (i.ar c237/c238)\n\nThe tool loop reuses ONE fsm (TRET-\u003eWAIT re-send); :position is set\nonce at request setup and never advanced, so post-response hooks fired\nwith [position, tracking) = the ENTIRE conversation. Consumers\nreceived the whole history every turn. THREE latent bugs shared this\nroot, all fixed by per-turn regions:\n\n1. Whole-conversation dump: i.ar cycle.log/one-shot log appended the\n   entire conversation every cycle (c236 census: 84% of both logs was\n   duplication). The 09-22 nocturne fragment was manufactured by\n   exactly this shape (delimiter pair inside a tool-result preview in\n   the dumped region).\n\n2. Mid-run ERRS fired hooks with start\u003cend (whole conversation) even\n   though the failed turn inserted nothing -- the failed-request\n   convention (start==end) never held for mid-run failures, so the\n   i.ar strike logic never saw them.\n\n3. iar--cycle-cross-response-repetition-p accumulated whole-\n   conversation line counts per call (quadratic false-positive\n   pressure); iar--cycle-output-runaway-p (20 identical lines) could\n   false-positive on a line repeated 20x ACROSS turns.\n\nFix: gptel-request.el handle-wait snapshots :turn-start (copy-marker\nof tracking) before every tool-loop re-send; gptel.el DONE/ERRS/ABRT\nhandlers fire post-response hooks with (or :turn-start :position) as\nregion start. Consumers now receive only the new turn. Single-turn\nrequests unchanged (no tracking marker -\u003e :position).\n\nConsumer audit (c237): pulse/font-lock/attach-after cosmetic; vterm\nnow CORRECT (copies response, was whole conversation); org cleanup-fn\nskips on turn 2+ in org tool loops (one temp-buf leak, tiny,\ndocumented; i.ar cycles run text-mode); delegates safe (:turn-start is\nper-INFO); c348 gate safe.\" 2\u003e\u00261 | tail -3\ngit log --oneline -3"}}}]},"done":false}\n{"model":"glm-5.3-flash","created_at":"2026-09-22T20:41:53.537532023Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":""},"done":false}\n{"model":"glm-5.3-flash","created_at":"2026-09-22T20:41:53.640559499Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":""},"done":true,"done_reason":"stop","total_duration":5240527097,"prompt_eval_count":67038,"prompt_eval_cached_count":58240,"eval_count":487}\n(4d73544a7dca567c48a57bc2745d9132 . 624)
